{"attribution":"Federal Emergency Management Agency, Ready.gov, Tornadoes, Simplified Chinese; no FEMA, DHS, or U.S. Government endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-001","input":"龙卷风是剧烈旋转的气柱，从雷暴延伸到地面，能摧毁建筑物，翻转汽车，并产生致命的飞溅碎片。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-002","input":"带来强风，每小时超过 200 英里。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-003","input":"使用国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 气象电台、当地新闻或官方社交媒体网站，获取最新的紧急信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-004","input":"遵循州府、地方和部落官员的指示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"立即前往安全的避难所，例如，安全室、地下室、风暴地窖或坚固建筑物最低层的小型室内房间。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-006","input":"远离窗户、房门和外墙。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-007","input":"不要在立交桥或桥下行走。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"在平坦的低处更安全。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-009","input":"注意可能导致受伤或死亡的飞溅碎片。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-010","input":"用手臂护住头部和颈部。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-011","input":"如果不能待在家里，计划前往公共避难所。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-012","input":"了解所在地区的龙卷风风险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-013","input":"在美国，中西部和东南部更可能发生龙卷风。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"了解龙卷风的迹象，包括旋转的漏斗状云、接近的碎片云，或像货运列车一样的巨响。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-015","input":"注册社区警报系统。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-016","input":"紧急警示系统 (EAS) 和国家海洋和国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 气象电台也提供紧急情况警示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-017","input":"如果社区有警报器，应熟悉警报音。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-018","input":"气象员能预测什么情况最可能发生龙卷风。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"识别并练习前往安全避难所，例如，使用 FEMA 标准建造的安全室或根据 ICC 500 标准建造的风暴避难所。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-020","input":"下一个最佳保护措施是坚固建筑物最低层的小型室内无窗房间或地下室。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"为宠物制定计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"宠物也是重要的亲人，因此需要纳入家庭应急计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-023","input":"为长期待在家里或就地避难做好准备，收集应急用品、清洁用品、不易腐烂的食物、用水、医疗用品和药物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-024","input":"立即前往确定的安全地点。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-025","input":"注意紧急警示系统 (EAS)、国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 天气电台或当地警示系统，了解最新紧急情况信息和说明。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-026","input":"保护好自己，用手臂遮住头部和颈部，将家具和毯子等材料放在周围或头顶。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"不要试图开车跑过龙卷风。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-028","input":"如在车内或室外且无法进入建筑物，尽可能用手臂遮住头部和颈部，并用外套或毯子遮住身体。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"非紧急情况不要打电话，用短信或社交媒体与亲朋交流。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"注意紧急警示系统 (EAS)、国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 天气电台和地方当局，了解最新信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-031","input":"远离掉落的电线或损坏的公用设施线路。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"如果生病并需就医，联系医务人员。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-033","input":"等待进一步的医治指示并继续就地避难。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"在清理过程中，穿戴合适的装备，例如，厚底鞋、长裤和工作手套，清理霉菌或其他碎屑时，戴上合适的面罩或口罩。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ready-gov-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese paragraph and list-item sentences from the checksum-pinned Ready.gov main element, removed navigation, images, external resources, phone/URL instructions, page furniture, and exact duplicates, and added input-only provenance; no expected text or converter output was used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"article":34},"eligible_pending_review":34,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":34},"upstream_revision":"Ready.gov Simplified Chinese Tornadoes; page last updated 2025-11-12; retrieved HTML SHA-256: f9fcbe3c53fb45f1f948046eb0864905bbdc7915762ad5a0c60c7063e0b2ebdd","version":1}
